# Nine-slice frame, 4px border: the timber shelf the shop cards sit on.
#
# Wood outside, felt inside. Keeping the shop's material distinct from the
# board's is what makes drag-to-place feel like it goes somewhere — you are
# moving a piece off the shelf and onto the table.
name autobattler-ui-frame
size 16 16
key o outline
key W wood-2
key w wood-0-shadow
key k felt-1
key K felt-0-shadow
